From b0fe366672b1c7f223ea88417c0e7d22dd006e9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:51:30 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] clip: Adds 'Clip.Icon' to the state, for the Clip's image.

Like the Dock's 'Icon': The Clip's tile shows the 'Icon' of the 'Clip'
section of the state file: A path, or a name in
${XDG_DATA_DIRS}/wlmaker/icons. Without it (or when it is not found), the
icon configured at build time (CMake WLMAKER_CLIP_DEFAULT_ICON), else
clip-56x56.png, as before. Distributions can ship their own Clip icon
without replacing wlmaker's clip-56x56.png.

Unit test for finding the image.
